%% title: Recommended Backend Architecture — Decoupled High-Throughput Topology
%% description: Conceptual target architecture for scaling Cynbit's SaaS products, AI automation workers, and APIs. Separates public routing, gateway authentication, application domains, caching, and persistence into discrete layers.

graph TB

    subgraph Client_Layer ["1. Client & Ingress Tier"]
        Client["Web / Mobile / Third-Party Clients"]
        EdgeWAF["Edge CDN & WAF (e.g., Cloudflare / Vercel Edge)\n• Edge Rate Limiting & Bot Filtering\n• Strict Security Header Injection (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options)"]
    end

    subgraph Gateway_Layer ["2. API Gateway & Middleware Pipeline"]
        Gateway["Reverse Proxy & Gateway\n• Correlation ID Middleware (x-request-id)\n• Strict CORS Origin Whitelist"]
        RateLimit["Rate Limiting Middleware\n• Fixed-Window Atomic Lua Counter\n• RFC 9333 Headers (Limit, Remaining, Reset)\n• Process-Local In-Memory Fallback"]
        AuthGuard["Authentication & Authorization Guard\n• Timing-Safe JWT Verification (jose HS256)\n• 60s Clock-Skew Tolerance\n• RBAC Middleware (requireRoles)"]
    end

    subgraph App_Layer ["3. Application Services Tier (Node.js / Express / NestJS)"]
        Controller["Inquiry Controller\n• DTO extraction & status orchestration\n• Standardized ApiResponse envelope"]
        Validation["Zod Validation Layer\n• Runtime schema parsing\n• Unicode name support (\p{L})\n• Anti-bot honeypot trapping"]
        Service["Inquiry Business Service\n• Domain business logic & transactions\n• Async worker job dispatching"]
        Repository["Inquiry Repository\n• Typed Prisma ORM query builder\n• Read-through cache coordination"]
    end

    subgraph Cache_Queue ["4. Cache & Async Worker Tier"]
        Redis[("Redis Cluster\n• Atomic rate limit counters\n• Session revocation store\n• Read-through query cache")]
        BullMQ["BullMQ / Message Queue\n• Asynchronous email & webhook queuing\n• Retry policies & dead-letter queues"]
        Workers["Background Async Workers\n• Transactional email dispatch\n• AI agent orchestration & webhooks"]
    end

    subgraph Persistence_Layer ["5. Data Persistence Tier"]
        PgBouncer["Connection Pooler (PgBouncer)\n• Mitigates connection exhaustion"]
        Postgres[("PostgreSQL 16 (Primary OLTP)\n• Relational tables & indexes\n• Parameterized queries (SQLi immune)")]
        Replica[("Read Replica (Optional)\n• Dedicated analytics & dashboard reads")]
    end

    subgraph Observability_Tier ["6. Observability & Monitoring"]
        Logging["Structured JSON Logger (Pino)\n• Unified logs with correlation requestId"]
        Sentry["Error Tracking & Alerting (Sentry)\n• Intercepts uncaught exceptions"]
        Metrics["Prometheus / OpenTelemetry Metrics\n• Real-time latency, throughput, and error rates"]
    end

    %% Flows
    Client -->|"HTTPS / TLS 1.3"| EdgeWAF
    EdgeWAF --> Gateway
    Gateway --> RateLimit
    RateLimit --> AuthGuard
    AuthGuard --> Controller
    Controller --> Validation
    Validation --> Service
    Service --> Repository

    %% Infrastructure Links
    RateLimit -.->|"atomic PTTL check"| Redis
    AuthGuard -.->|"session revocation check"| Redis
    Repository -.->|"read-through cache / del"| Redis
    Service -.->|"enqueue async tasks"| BullMQ
    BullMQ --> Workers
    Repository --> PgBouncer
    PgBouncer --> Postgres
    Postgres -.->|"streaming replication"| Replica

    %% Observability taps
    Controller -.-> Logging
    Service -.-> Sentry
    Gateway -.-> Metrics
